       role may correct a result but not create one. */
    bdsis_require_can('view', null, 'bacteriology');

    /* Only these centres run the bench, so a facility user from anywhere else has
       no business on this screen even for their own patient. It is a rule about
       where results are PRODUCED, so it applies to the facility role only: a
       district health officer reviews the sentinel sites in their dzongkhag and
       need not sit at one -- gating them on their own centre locked them out of
       the module entirely. National roles were always exempt. */
    $micro_site = array('016', '063', '128', '143', '997');
    if (bdsis_scope() === BDSIS_SCOPE_FACILITY AND !in_array($ctid, $micro_site, true)) {
