     */
    /**
     * Which mode a section's form opens in.
     *
     *   add   the section holds nothing yet, so there is nothing to view and
     *         the form opens ready to fill, exactly as it always has.
     *   view  the section holds a result: every control is inert until the
     *         user presses Edit. A record that may not be saved at all
